1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:39,740
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:44,030
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,350
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:03,160
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:11,060
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 15=

12
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:16,400
Don't you think

13
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,880
Fusheng is acting strange?

14
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:20,960
You suspect him?

15
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,000
No, I don't.

16
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:25,600
I checked.

17
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:27,760
There's no shamanic energy
on him at all.

18
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:30,200
Then I must be overthinking it.

19
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,200
Then,

20
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:35,720
what do we do about Mrs. Zhao?

21
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:38,000
I can't tell what shamanic arts

22
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,400
were used on her.

23
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:40,960
We may need the Grand Shaman

24
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,240
to come and take a look.

25
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:48,800
Chu Li,

26
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:51,200
you're no longer
part of our Shaman Clan.

27
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,880
Yet you dare come back?

28
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:54,000
Yun Hua,

29
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,120
we've come today

30
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,680
because I need to see the Grand Shaman.

31
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,240
Diviner Song,

32
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:04,280
you keep helping
this traitor of the Shaman Clan.

33
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,840
Aren't you being a little too partial?

34
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:08,160
Yun Hua,

35
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,600
you keep blocking us

36
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,680
from seeing the Grand Shaman.

37
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,040
Now I'm starting to wonder

38
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:14,000
if you've done something to her.

39
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:16,400
I'm the Grand Shaman's
direct disciple.

40
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,760
While she's in seclusion,

41
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:19,480
of course I'm guarding her.

42
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:22,400
Don't project your filthy thoughts
onto me.

43
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:25,080
I'll know once I see her for myself.

44
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:25,840
You can't.

45
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,120
- Grand Shaman!
- Chu Li!

46
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,040
Stop right there!

47
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,400
I request an audience!

48
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:04,400
Grand Shaman!

49
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,720
Traitor!

50
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,800
How dare you
disturb the Grand Shaman's seclusion!

51
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:08,600
I will

52
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,000
see the Grand Shaman today.

53
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,520
Then try

54
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:12,880
getting past me.

55
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,480
Both of you, stop!

56
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,880
Grand Shaman, why...

57
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:29,320
Grand Shaman,

58
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,200
are you all right?

59
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:32,720
Diviner Song,

60
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:34,880
what brings you here

61
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,720
so suddenly today?

62
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:39,160
Grand Shaman,

63
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,680
something strange has happened
at my home.

64
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,360
I beg you to come and shed light on it.

65
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,040
Grand Shaman, you mustn't!

66
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:52,240
Very well.

67
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:56,200
I will go with you, Diviner Song.

68
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:57,680
Thank you, Grand Shaman.

69
00:03:59,280 --> 00:03:59,960
After you.

70
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,320
Grand Shaman!

71
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,400
She's under a gu curse.

72
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,160
A gu curse?

73
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:38,480
What kind?

74
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:47,080
This gu curse isn't fatal.

75
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,480
It only puts her into a deep sleep.

76
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,800
In ten days, she'll wake on her own.

77
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,680
But the child she carries...

78
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,240
Without food or water for ten days,

79
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,840
even if she survives,

80
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:01,480
her child will die.

81
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:09,800
Is there any way to lift the gu curse?

82
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,400
There is none.

83
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,840
You can only wait for her to wake

84
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,160
after ten days.

85
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,320
But that way,

86
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:19,800
her child will die.

87
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,440
That is its fate.

88
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:22,560
But...

89
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:25,480
The child is already tainted
with evil energy.

90
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,160
We can't even trace the source.

91
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,240
The child won't survive to be born,

92
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:32,440
and it will endanger its mother.

93
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:41,160
In that case,

94
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:44,120
it's better to let the child die early

95
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,480
and preserve the mother's life.

96
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,280
Understood.

97
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,960
So she loses a baby.

98
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,680
What's the big deal?

99
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,800
Diviner Song,

100
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,800
this is all I can do.

101
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,560
Thank you, Grand Shaman.

102
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,240
Grand Shaman!

103
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:20,960
Mother!

104
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,200
Don't call me that.

105
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,240
Fine.

106
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,480
Grand Shaman,

107
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,000
do you really hate me that much?

108
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:33,200
I've already driven you out
of the Shaman Clan.

109
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:36,480
From now on, you and I have no ties.

110
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:37,960
So you don't even care

111
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,720
if I live or die?

112
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:43,880
Everyone has their own fate.

113
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:48,280
You weren't like this before.

114
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,800
How did you become like this?

115
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,960
There's no point in talking.

116
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,640
I never want to see you again.

117
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,640
Stop fooling yourself.

118
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,200
Leave Jinan City soon.

119
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,000
Stay out of my sight.

120
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,560
What did I do wrong

121
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:03,800
for you to treat me like this?

122
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,680
Your very existence is a mistake.

123
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,480
That's your mistake,

124
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,680
not mine.

125
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:25,000
If you want to save that woman,

126
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:27,080
you'll need the Soul-Retrieving Talisman

127
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:29,080
to protect the child in her belly

128
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,920
and get it through those ten days.

129
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,160
But that child is tainted
with evil energy.

130
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,920
It may not survive.

131
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:39,600
So I advise you
not to waste your effort.

132
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,880
Leave Jinan City soon.

133
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,720
I never want to see you again.

134
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:10,000
Does she really hate me that much?

135
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,720
For now, the child in her belly is safe.

136
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:38,440
But

137
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:40,320
we still can't trace the source
of that evil force.

138
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:42,080
The child

139
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,320
may not survive.

140
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,960
We won't know for sure

141
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,880
until she wakes up.

142
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,800
So it seems

143
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,760
this is the child's fate.

144
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,560
Once Mrs. Zhao's child is born,

145
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,320
I'll leave Jinan City.

146
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,760
Really?

147
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,000
Chu Li,

148
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,080
all that matters is

149
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:13,000
that you're alive and well.

150
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,320
There are still 14 days.

151
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:16,880
When the time comes,

152
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,080
would you be willing

153
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,440
to leave with me?

154
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:25,560
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

155
00:09:25,560 --> 00:09:26,280
Fine.

156
00:09:28,740 --> 00:09:35,580
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

157
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:39,220
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

158
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:42,620
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

159
00:09:42,620 --> 00:09:49,440
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

160
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,280
(Li,)

161
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,280
(this time,)

162
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:55,240
(you can finally end this cycle.)

163
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:14,880
What are you doing?

164
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:17,960
You caught me.

165
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:19,480
How boring.

166
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:22,720
Chu Li,

167
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:24,360
what's wrong?

168
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:26,080
Lately,

169
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:28,080
you're always so secretive
with Diviner Song,

170
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:29,480
never bringing me along.

171
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,200
Fusheng,

172
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:34,840
in a few days,

173
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,600
I'm leaving Jinan City.

174
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,240
When the time comes,

175
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,480
would you be willing to come with me?

176
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,640
Chu Li,

177
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:49,080
did something happen?

178
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:50,480
Don't ask.

179
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:52,320
Just tell me, will you come with me
or not?

180
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,360
Of course I will.

181
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,520
I told you,

182
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,360
I'll always be by your side.

183
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,320
Grand Shaman, are you all right?

184
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,000
Grand Shaman!

185
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:22,920
Are you all right?

186
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:23,840
Do you need me to...

187
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,800
Have the others left?

188
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,960
I've arranged for them to leave.

189
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:30,640
Good.

190
00:11:30,800 --> 00:11:31,680
What about you?

191
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:32,880
Why haven't you left?

192
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:33,600
I'm not leaving.

193
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:35,480
Grand Shaman,
I'm staying to protect you.

194
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,920
I don't need you to protect me.

195
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,960
Leave Jinan City at once.

196
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:41,160
Go!

197
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:43,120
I won't go. I'm not leaving.

198
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,720
No matter what happens to Jinan City,

199
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:46,000
I'll stay with you.

200
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,080
You...

201
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:49,880
Grand Shaman,

202
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:50,960
don't push yourself.

203
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:51,960
Let me help you.

204
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,160
I don't need your help.

205
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:56,040
Go, now!

206
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,200
Grand Shaman!

207
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:04,640
Go!

208
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:08,320
Leave!

209
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,400
Yun Hua!

210
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:32,000
Grand Shaman, I'm here.

211
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:34,720
Go deliver a message to Song Ziyuan now.

212
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,160
Song Ziyuan?

213
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,680
Don't let Chu Li know.

214
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:43,320
Understood.

215
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,600
Master,

216
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:53,240
Lanruo entered Jinan City a month ago

217
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,400
and became a singer.

218
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:56,880
She was later introduced at court
by a palace musician.

219
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:58,320
She won the King's favor

220
00:12:58,520 --> 00:12:59,640
and became Beautiful Lady Lan.

221
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,280
Beyond that,

222
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:03,320
I couldn't find any information

223
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,800
on her outside Jinan City.

224
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:05,840
I see.

225
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,960
These are all my assets.

226
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,120
Take them and sell them.

227
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:19,680
Then, escort Chu Li

228
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:21,200
out of the city with the money.

229
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:22,640
Master,

230
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:23,920
why are you doing this?

231
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:25,840
Don't ask.

232
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:29,200
Just protect Chu Li.

233
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,240
Only if she's safe

234
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:32,600
can I be at peace.

235
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:35,400
Understood.

236
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:38,320
Once I've escorted Miss Chu Li
out of the city,

237
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:39,560
I'll come back right away.

238
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,400
Shiqi,

239
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:48,840
don't come back.

240
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:50,800
From now on,

241
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,160
she is your master.

242
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,080
Master,

243
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:56,920
I can't leave you alone in Jinan City.

244
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:58,680
Are you defying my orders now?

245
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,120
I wouldn't dare.

246
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,400
Then do as I say.

247
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:12,480
Understood.

248
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,000
(Li,)

249
00:14:22,760 --> 00:14:23,680
(in this lifetime,)

250
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:27,080
(I can finally save you.)

251
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:37,040
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

252
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:44,120
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

253
00:14:44,490 --> 00:14:47,820
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

254
00:14:47,990 --> 00:14:51,190
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

255
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:58,170
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

256
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:05,250
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

257
00:15:05,540 --> 00:15:11,910
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

258
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:15,510
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

259
00:15:15,770 --> 00:15:18,980
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

260
00:15:19,020 --> 00:15:25,900
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

261
00:15:26,260 --> 00:15:29,790
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

262
00:15:29,940 --> 00:15:33,510
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

263
00:15:33,900 --> 00:15:40,350
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

264
00:16:09,250 --> 00:16:15,920
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

265
00:16:16,180 --> 00:16:22,470
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
